('1ce4a5c0-0000-4000-8000-000000001030', '1ce4a5c0-0000-4000-8000-000000000031', '1ce4a5c0-0000-4000-8000-000000000011', null, 'inbound', $str$Hi Yashwant, please find the answers below -
1. Stillness offers experiential somatic anchoring. While "wellness" can often feel abstract, passive, or overly aesthetic, Stillness offers active, immersive transitions from mental overload to deep physical and nervous system regulation. It is the practice of moving people out of their heads and into their bodies through soundbtaths, breathwork, and sensory experiences (like the floating sound journeys). The core offering isn't just relaxation; it is the curation of deliberate space where adults and children can safely pause, ground, and reset.
2. Immersive Group Experiences: The facilitation of highly intentional group journeys—whether that is anchoring outdoor floating sound journeys, breathwork sessions, or specialized men’s grounding and journaling circles. We dnt operate from a single location. 
3. Individuals who carry immense responsibility, decision fatigue, and mental noise. They don't want a "luxury spa" gimmick; they want an authentic, grounding sanctuary to drop their armor. Mindful parents looking for practical, screen-free, somatic tools. Adults, high achievers, kids and families who prioritize self care and wellness. 
4. Monthly session - these premium, consistently sold-out community experiences serve as the perfect, experiential entry point.$str$, '2026-07-13T00:35:18+05:30'::timestamptz, 'filed', null, $str$_chat.txt L40$str$, null, (select id from public.app_users where is_active = true order by created_at limit 1)),
